#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Akiyama"
msgid "(Huh?)"
msgstr "(¿Eh?)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Akiyama"
msgid "(What's with him? He better not be stalking my girls...)"
msgstr "(¿Y este tipo? Espero que no esté acosando a las chicas...)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey! What are you doing?"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¿Qué haces?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Shady Man"
msgid "Whoa!"
msgstr "¡Woa!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Shady Man"
msgid "Uh, nothing!"
msgstr "Eh, ¡nada!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "You were sneaking a look at something."
msgstr "Pareciera que estás husmeando algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Shady Man"
msgid "Sneaking a look? No, I was just waiting for somebody."
msgstr "¿Husmeando? Para nada, solo estaba esperando a alguien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "For who?"
msgstr "¿A quién?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Shady Man"
msgid "Er－there she is!"
msgstr "¡Eh, a Miki-chan!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Akiyama"
msgid "Who? You mean Miki?"
msgstr "¿Miki? ¿Te refieres a ella?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Shady Man"
msgid "Oh, do you know her?"
msgstr "Oh, ¿también conoces a Miki-chan?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. I own this place."
msgstr "Pues claro. Soy el dueño de este club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Shady Man"
msgid "Whaaa－!?"
msgstr "¡¿Quéééééé - ?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "And who might you be, hmm? A stalker, perhaps?"
msgstr "¿Y tú quién eres, mmm? ¿Su acosador, quizás?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Shady Man"
msgid "No, no, nothing like that. I just wanted to see her..."
msgstr "No, no, de ninguna forma. Solo necesitaba verla..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "Are you one of her customers?"
msgstr "¿Eres uno de sus clientes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Shady Man"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "Ajá."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Why not just go into the club, then?"
msgstr "¿Entonces por qué no entras al club y ya?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Shady Man"
msgid "Well, the thing is..."
msgstr "Bueno, la cosa es que..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Shady Man"
msgid "I've spent more than five million yen here over the past two\\r\nyears, and it looks like my money's finally run out..."
msgstr "Me he gastado más de cinco millones de yenes aquí en los\\r\núltimos dos años, y creo que ya no me queda nada..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Akiyama"
msgid "Five million yen!?"
msgstr "¡¿Cinco millones de yenes?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Shady Man"
msgid "That's right. I was <Italic>this close</Italic> to winning her over, too..."
msgstr "Así es. Además, estuve <Italic>así de cerca</Italic> de conquistarla..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "If five million yen wasn't enough, I think it might be time to call it quits."
msgstr "Si cinco millones no fueron suficientes, creo que ya es hora de dejarlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Shady Man"
msgid "I just know I could do it if I had another million..."
msgstr "Estoy seguro de que sería capaz de hacerlo si tuviera otro millón..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Akiyama"
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te llamas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Taniguchi"
msgid "Taniguchi."
msgstr "Taniguchi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm Akiyama. In addition to this club, I also run a loan\\r\noffice called Sky Finance."
msgstr "Me llamo Akiyama. Además de este club, también\\r\nmanejo una agencia de préstamos llamada Sky Finance."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Taniguchi"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Guau..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Akiyama"
msgid "Look, the way things are now, you've got a snowball's chance\\r\nin hell of going out with Miki."
msgstr "Escúchame, por como van las cosas ahora, es más probable\\r\nque un cerdo vuele a que salgas con Miki."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Taniguchi"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Akiyama"
msgid "Even with another million yen, unless you make some changes,\\r\nyou could see her ten more times and still get absolutely\\r\nnowhere."
msgstr "Si no haces algunos cambios, incluso con otro millón de yenes,\\r\naunque la vieras diez veces más, no llegarías a ningún\\r\nlado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Taniguchi"
msgid "Great..."
msgstr "Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Akiyama"
msgid "Besides, you need more than just money to woo a woman.\\r\nFirst, you have to work on your look. Then comes building\\r\nup your own personal brand of charm."
msgstr "Además, hace falta más que solo dinero para conquistar una mujer.\\r\nPrimero, debes mejorar tu aspecto. Después tienes que trabajar en\\r\nti mismo para tener tu propio encanto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Taniguchi"
msgid "But how do I do all that?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿cómo hago todo eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Akiyama"
msgid "Meet me in front of the Millennium Tower later. I'll give you a\\r\nlittle advice."
msgstr "Encontrémonos en la Torre Milennium más tarde.\\r\nTe ayudaré con algunos consejos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Taniguchi"
msgid "You'd do that for me?"
msgstr "¿Harías eso por mí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. Wouldn't be much of an owner if I didn't step in to\\r\nhelp such a loyal customer."
msgstr "Claro, no puedo dejar a la deriva a un cliente que se\\r\ngastó cinco millones de yenes en uno de mis locales."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Taniguchi"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Muchas gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, and the next time we meet, come all decked out in your\\r\nlady-killer best."
msgstr "Oh, y cuándo nos veamos, ven preparado con tu mejor\\r\noutfit seductor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Taniguchi"
msgid "Lady-killer?"
msgstr "¿Seductor?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Akiyama"
msgid "You know, the clothes you'd wear if you had the chance to go\\r\nout on a date with Miki! I want to get a feel for your sense\\r\nof style."
msgstr "Ya sabes, ¡la ropa que usarías si tuvieras la oportunidad de\\r\nsalir a una cita con Miki! Quiero saber cuál es tu sentido\\r\nde la moda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_Taniguchi"
msgid "Oh, er, okay... I will. I'll see you later, then. And thanks\\r\nagain."
msgstr "Oh, eh, está bien... Lo haré. Entonces te veo luego. Y gracias\\r\nde nuevo."

